    "document": "R1Small-Scale-Multi-Unit-Housing-District.pdf",
    "city": "Burnaby",
    "zone": "R1",
    "scope": "Rules applicable when constructing a Front Principal Building or Rear Principal Building under Burnaby R1 Small-Scale Multi-Unit Housing District.",
    "notes": [
      "Setbacks (s.101.4) apply to All Buildings — both front and rear principals share the same setback table.",
      "Height and storeys differ between front and rear principal buildings.",
      "Separation rules depend on which pair of buildings is involved.",
      "Dwelling-type columns in the table: Rowhouse (1-3 units), Small-Scale 1-2 units, Small-Scale 3-4 units, Small-Scale 5-6 units (FTNA only).",
      "Rules marked applies_to=all_principal_buildings apply equally to both front and rear principals."
    ],
    "source_sections": {
      "101.3": "Subdivision Regulations (lot width, lot area)",
      "101.4": "Development Regulations (main table: coverage, height, setbacks, separations)",
